{{JPExclusive}}
:''For the enemy units found in the [[Castle & Dragon Collaboration Event]], see [[Battle Balloon (Enemy)]] or [[Battle UFO (Enemy)]].''
'''Battle Balloon''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] that can be unlocked during the [[Castle & Dragon Collaboration Event]] by completing the stage [[Pretend to Watch]] with a [[Timed Score Reward|Timed Score]] of at least 4,500. It was added in [[Version 4.6 Update|Version 4.6]]. [[True Form]] also added in Version 4.6 slightly increased range.

{{Cat Info
|ID = 252
|rarity = RR
|name1 = Battle Balloon
|name2 = Pirate Battle Balloon
|name3 = Battle UFO
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Pirate Battle Balloon''' at level 10.

Evolves into '''Battle UFO''' when obtained from [[Road to Battle Balloon Evolution (Normal)|Road to Battle Balloon Evolution]] and is level 20 or above.

==Strategy/Usage==
This unit is essentially a worse version of [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]] in all but a few aspects. It does have its uses though; it can increase your [[User Rank]], and it can be stacked in very early [[Legend Stages|Stories of Legend]] stages for some DPS. Otherwise, it's useless beyond that point.

{{Job|Classification = User Rank Dump}}

